  "description": "Style resolution and page layout for DocWright Word documents: flattens defaults, styles, numbering and theme into concrete formatting, then produces positioned pages (line breaking, tabs, page and column breaks, tables across pages, floating objects and wrapping, headers, footers and notes) that the PDF and image renderers draw. Also font preflight, incremental relayout after an edit, Web/Draft/Outline views and Word-style document statistics. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
